<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Carlo Buccisano</title><link>https://carlobuccisano.com/</link><description>Recent content on Carlo Buccisano</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://carlobuccisano.com/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>https://carlobuccisano.com/colophon/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://carlobuccisano.com/colophon/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="colophon"&gt;Colophon&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This website has been created using &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io/"&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;. It is hosted by &lt;a href="https://pages.github.com/"&gt;GitHub Pages&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://carlobuccisano.com/cv/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://carlobuccisano.com/cv/</guid><description>&lt;div class="cv_div"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3 class="cv_table_title"&gt;&#10; Work Experience&#10; &lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;ul class="cv_list"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2026 - now &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Software Engineer&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; Backend and algorithms: Kotlin, Python and SQL&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2024 - 2025 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Attaché Temporaire d'Enseignement et de Recherche&lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/"&gt;Institut Mathématiques d'Orsay&lt;/a&gt;, France&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; July 2015 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Computer Programmer (Intern) &lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-computer istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.ibm.com/"&gt;IBM&lt;/a&gt;, United Kingdom&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="cv_div"&gt;&#10; &lt;h3 class="cv_table_title"&gt;&#10; Education&#10; &lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;ul class="cv_list"&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2021 - 2025 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; PhD in Mathematics &lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/"&gt;Institut Mathématiques d'Orsay&lt;/a&gt;, France&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2016 - 2022 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Galileian School Diploma &lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://scuolagalileiana.unipd.it/"&gt;Galileian School of Higher Studies&lt;/a&gt;, Padova (Italy)&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2019 - 2021 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Master Degree in Mathematics &lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://algant.eu"&gt;ALGANT Double Degree&lt;/a&gt;, Padova (Italy) and Orsay (France)&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li class="cv_list_item"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_education_row"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_little_left_box"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="cv_years_box"&gt; 2016 - 2019 &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="cv_row_right_part"&gt;&#10; &lt;h4 class="cv_entry"&gt; Undergraduate Degree in Mathematics &lt;/h4&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns istituto"&gt; &lt;/i&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.math.unipd.it/"&gt;University of Padua&lt;/a&gt;, Italy&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://carlobuccisano.com/mathematics/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://carlobuccisano.com/mathematics/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="some-background"&gt;Some background&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I hold a PhD in Mathematics from the &lt;a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/"&gt;Orsay Mathematics Department&lt;/a&gt; under the supervision of &lt;a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/~hennion/"&gt;Benjamin Hennion&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://www.imo.universite-paris-saclay.fr/~macri/"&gt;Emanuele Macrì&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://carlobuccisano.com/teaching/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://carlobuccisano.com/teaching/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="teaching-activities"&gt;Teaching Activities&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Here is a list of all my teaching activities. The names refer to courses taught at &lt;a href="https://www.universite-paris-saclay.fr/"&gt;Paris-Saclay University&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;span class="text-faint small"&gt;&#10;Basic conventions: &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;L&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;N&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;LN&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal"&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;"&gt;N&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; refers to the &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;N&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;N&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;"&gt;N&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;-th year of undergraduate, &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;M&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;M&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.10903em;"&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; refers to math, &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;P&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;P&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.13889em;"&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to physics, &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;I&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;I&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.07847em;"&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to computer science and &lt;span class="katex"&gt;&lt;span class="katex-mathml"&gt;&lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"&gt;&lt;semantics&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;D&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;D&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;annotation encoding="application/x-tex"&gt;DD&lt;/annotation&gt;&lt;/semantics&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;span class="base"&gt;&lt;span class="strut" style="height:0.6833em;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;"&gt;DD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to double degree.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>